  {
   "title": "Kung with question words",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "t": "Besides showing the time of an action, **kung** can be paired with **question words** (Lesson 9) to make phrases that start with *as to*. When you translate them into English, *as to* may be left out."
    },
    {
     "type": "table",
     "head": [
      "Phrase",
      "Meaning"
     ],
     "rows": [
      [
       "[[kung síno|other]]",
       "as to who"
      ],
      [
       "[[kung anó|other]]",
       "as to what"
      ],
      [
       "[[kung saán|other]]",
       "as to where"
      ],
      [
       "[[kung alín|other]]",
       "as to which"
      ],
      [
       "[[kung kailán|other]]",
       "as to when"
      ],
      [
       "[[kung paáno|other]]",
       "as to how"
      ],
      [
       "[[kung kaníno|other]]",
       "as to whom"
      ]
     ],
